y%C3%BCk%C5%9Fehir_Belediyespor_(basket-ball)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Manisa B\u00fcy\u00fck\u015fehir Belediyespor (basket-ball)\">Manisa BB</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Paris_Basketball\" title=\"Paris Basketball\">Paris Basketball</a></td><td valign=\"top\"><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>0,5<br />13,1<br />13,5<br />11,2<br />10,5<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>6,9<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>8,1<br />11,7<br />-</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">S\u00e9lection en \u00e9quipe nationale **</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">2024-</td><td valign=\"top\"><span class=\"nowrap\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Flag_of_Brazil.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Drapeau : Br\u00e9sil\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/05/Flag_of_Brazil.svg/20px-Flag_of_Brazil.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/05/Flag_of_Brazil.svg/40px-Flag_of_Brazil.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"700\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%89quipe_du_Br%C3%A9sil_masculine_de_basket-ball\" title=\"\u00c9quipe du Br\u00e9sil masculine de basket-ball\">Br\u00e9sil</a></span></td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<td colspan=\"3\"><hr style=\"height:2px; color:inherit; background-color:#DD8F56;\" /></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#555555;\"><small>* Points marqu\u00e9s dans chaque club dans le cadre de la saison r\u00e9guli\u00e8re du championnat national.</small></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#555555;\"><small>** Points marqu\u00e9s pour l\u2019\u00e9quipe nationale en match officiel.</small></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"navigation-only\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"border-top: 2px #DD8F56 solid; font-size: 80%; background:inherit; color: inherit; text-align: right;\"><span class=\"plainlinks\" style=\"float:left;\"><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//fr.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=M%C3%A3ozinha_Pereira&amp;action=edit&amp;section=0\" href=\"https://fr.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=M%C3%A3ozinha_Pereira&amp;action=edit&amp;section=0\"><span class=\"infodoc\">modifier</span></a></span>&#160;<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mod%C3%A8le:Infobox_Joueur_de_basket-ball\" title=\"Consultez la documentation du mod\u00e8le\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/20px-Info_Simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/40px-Info_Simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Jo\u00e3o Marcello Cardoso Pereira</b>, plus commun\u00e9ment connu sous le <a href=\"/wiki/Pseudonyme\" title=\"Pseudonyme\">pseudonyme</a> de <b>M\u00e3ozinha Pereira</b> et n\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap date-lien bday\" datetime=\"2000-08-28\" data-sort-value=\"2000-08-28\"><a href=\"/wiki/28_ao%C3%BBt_en_sport\" title=\"28 ao\u00fbt en sport\">28 ao\u00fbt</a> <a href=\"/wiki/2000_en_basket-ball\" title=\"2000 en basket-ball\">2000</a></time> \u00e0 <a href=\"/wiki/Rio_de_Janeiro\" title=\"Rio de Janeiro\">Rio de Janeiro</a> au <a href=\"/wiki/Br%C3%A9sil\" title=\"Br\u00e9sil\">Br\u00e9sil</a>, est un joueur <a href=\"/wiki/Br%C3%A9sil\" title=\"Br\u00e9sil\">br\u00e9silien</a> de <a href=\"/wiki/Basket-ball\" title=\"Basket-ball\">basket-ball</a> mesurant 2,01 m et \u00e9voluant au poste d'<a href=\"/wiki/Ailier_fort\" title=\"Ailier fort\">ailier fort</a>.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Biographie\">Biographie</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=M%C3%A3ozinha_Pereira&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Biographie\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=M%C3%A3ozinha_Pereira&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Biographie\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bandeau-container bandeau-section metadata bandeau-niveau-information\"><div class=\"bandeau-cell bandeau-icone\"><span class=\"mw-valign-text-top noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg/20px-Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"13\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg/40px-Logo_travaux_orange-simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"640\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"bandeau-cell\">Cette section est vide, insuffisamment d\u00e9taill\u00e9e ou incompl\u00e8te. <a href=\"/wiki/Sp%C3%A9cial:EditPage/M%C3%A3ozinha_Pereira\" title=\"Sp\u00e9cial:EditPage/M\u00e3ozinha Pereira\">Votre aide</a> est la bienvenue&#160;! <a href=\"/wiki/Aide:Comment_modifier_une_page\" title=\"Aide:Comment modifier une page\">Comment faire&#160;?</a></div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Carri\u00e8re_professionnelle\"><span id=\"Carri.C3.A8re_professionnelle\"></span>Carri\u00e8re professionnelle</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=M%C3%A3ozinha_Pereira&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Carri\u00e8re professionnelle\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=M%C3%A3ozinha_Pereira&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Carri\u00e8re professionnelle\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>En <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2024-03\" data-sort-value=\"2024-03\">mars 2024</time>, Pereira rejoint les <a href=\"/wiki/Grizzlies_de_Memphis\" title=\"Grizzlies de Memphis\">Grizzlies de Memphis</a> avec lesquels il s'engage pour 10 jours<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>En <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2026-07\" data-sort-value=\"2026-07\">juillet 2026</time>, il rejoint le <a href=\"/wiki/Paris_Basketball\" title=\"Paris Basketball\">Paris Basketball</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Statistiques\">Statistiques</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=M%C3%A3ozinha_Pereira&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Modifier l